The last two rows are the same assignment on the overflow-policy axis
(saturate) and the same assignment on every other axis. They differ only
in the width the limit is read at, which is `40` section 5.2's convention,
and they put the headroom axis on opposite sides of the cut. `40` argued
that from `20`'s factoring result and called it a canon-shaped sentence
nobody has written. No file in the strategy-axis unit carries it.
